/P 77 0 R
/E (It can be observed that Gujarat Fluorochemicals has the highest Scope 2 emissions amongst all, while Naveen seems to have the highest emissions intensity among all. Being a smaller company than the rest, Naveen needs to invest more in improving its operational efficiency in anticipation of a future where its business expands and it will inevitably face more pressure to reduce emissions per rupee of turnover. It seems that both Gujarat and Naveen can take notes from Tata in terms of minimizing their Scope 2 emissions compared to the size of their operations. )
